  "transcript": "Let’s open my work-experience suitcase.\n\nFrom twenty twenty-four to twenty twenty-five, I worked as a QA Engineer at Silverspin in Skövde. I created Playwright tests and manually tested a sportsbook, finding defects that were corrected before release.\n\nFrom twenty twenty to twenty twenty-four, I was an Application Support Consultant at Aptic. I handled support requests, wrote documentation, and investigated errors in Microsoft Dynamics NAV export files.\n\nFrom twenty seventeen to twenty twenty, I worked as a System Developer at Asitis. My work included manual testing, requirements, investigating defects in C slash A L code, and improving testing methods.\n\nEarlier, I worked at a garden nursery, caring for plants and selling products at markets.\n\nI also worked as a playhost for Tallink, organising children’s activities and hosting karaoke for adults.",
